  "138": {
    "class_type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
    "inputs": {
      "value": "那就在提示词开头明确三张图的用途，尤其是**第三张用于参考安装完成的产品外观，不要求镜头硬切或复刻它的构图**。英文版可以直接这样写：\n\nUse the three reference images as follows:\n- **Image 1:** Reference for the couple’s appearances and outfits.\n- **Image 2:** Reference for the home environment, Christmas decorations, lighting, and the bare door before installation.\n- **Image 3:** Reference for the door cover’s design, placement, and finished appearance after installation. Use it as a visual reference, not as a fixed frame to cut to or an exact composition to reproduce.\n\nThe woman is seated in the home shown in Image 2, with the packaged door cover resting on her lap. The camera looks down, framing only her lap, hands, and the packaging. She lightly taps the package twice with her fingertips, then opens the bag.\n\nUse a clean jump cut to the couple installing the Christmas door cover together. With the door open, the man fits the upper elastic corners over the top corners of the door while the woman helps arrange the lower section. Jump ahead to both the top and bottom secured as they straighten the fabric together. The woman smooths out the last wrinkle, then they close the door and walk out of frame.\n\nThe camera smoothly moves closer and aligns directly in front of the door. The complete door cover fills most of the frame height, with both its top and bottom edges fully visible, clearly showcasing the Santa design and fabric texture from Image 3. Keep the surrounding Christmas decorations consistent with Image 2, while reframing to show less floor and furniture and emphasize the product. End with a steady, unobstructed view of the finished result.\n\nAudio: Only natural sounds—light fingertip taps, packaging rustling, fabric movement, footsteps, and the door closing. No dialogue, background music, soundtrack, or musical effects."
    }
  },
